  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "hook",
      "text": "A designer bag costs three thousand dollars. But what does it really cost you?",
      "start": 0.35,
      "end": 4.388
    },
    {
      "key": "hours",
      "text": "If you earn twenty dollars an hour, that's a hundred and fifty hours of work. Almost a full month on the clock.",
      "start": 4.988,
      "end": 10.8
    },
    {
      "key": "replica",
      "text": "The replica? About a hundred dollars. That's five hours. Less than one shift.",
      "start": 11.4,
      "end": 15.58
    },
    {
      "key": "gap",
      "text": "That leaves a hundred and forty-five hours, and twenty-nine hundred dollars, back in your pocket.",
      "start": 16.18,
      "end": 21.222
    },
    {
      "key": "spend",
      "text": "That's a weekend trip, a new phone, and a fully stocked emergency fund.",
      "start": 21.822,
      "end": 25.739
    },
    {
      "key": "end",
      "text": "Same look either way. So how many hours is a logo worth to you?",
      "start": 26.339,
      "end": 29.8
    }
  ],
